Me, three!  No, just kidding.  You can get it via anonymous ftp from
simtel20.arpa.  Change directory to "pd2:<unix-c.utils>" and remember to
use tenex mode (i.e. not binary or text) and "get patch.tar.Z"

This means you need tar and compress, too.

For an added bonus, change directory to "pd2:<unix-c>" and get down in
text mode the file "000-MASTER-INDEX.TXT"  In it you will find a listing
of literally hundreds of great public domain stuff for unix systems.
All of the usual stuff and lots more (including tar, and compress!)
This is my personal software library 8-)

